{"2978460": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "HARD VOID", "steam_appid": 2978460, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HARD VOID is a Retro-style Lovecraft-inspired 4X space turn-based strategy game.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While recovering from past near-apocalyptic events, your civilization has developed faster-than-light travel methods under mysterious circumstances. Will this discovery lead to an age of space prosperity, or should some things better remain undiscovered?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Design your ships</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HARD VOID allows the design of your own spaceships with the selection of multiple ship systems: Weapons, Defense modules, Power sources, Sensors and more. Each ship system can be further customized with several parameters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally, the spaceship hulls are unique and generated procedurally.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978460/extras/32f9c385af18db79c6dad830f3ad16b5.avif?t=1783924175\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978460/extras/e68b800b5047f9d9215a68adc912c307.poster.avif?t=1783924175\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978460/extras/e68b800b5047f9d9215a68adc912c307.webm?t=1783924175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978460/extras/e68b800b5047f9d9215a68adc912c307.mp4?t=1783924175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Conquer the galaxy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In HARD VOID combat is turn-based, ships are grouped into fleets and commanded as a whole in large space battles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The combat system allows simultaneous participation of both space and ground forces: Fleets, orbital structures, planetary surface structure, land, air and sea units.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978460/extras/67c5e1c4b8572a8fddcc200e0100bccd.poster.avif?t=1783924175\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978460/extras/67c5e1c4b8572a8fddcc200e0100bccd.webm?t=1783924175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978460/extras/67c5e1c4b8572a8fddcc200e0100bccd.mp4?t=1783924175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Colonize the galaxy and multiple dimensions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use multiple FTL travel methods to explore and expand : WARP drives, Subspatial engines, Wormhole generators and more. Colonize planets, asteroids and multiple dimensions, but beware, you aren't only dealing with just other species, space travel unlocks horrors beyond comprehension that are waiting in the vast dark void and will trial your empire. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978460/extras/02d6a58d4ffd87a963caae87f97ad9fc.poster.avif?t=1783924175\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978460/extras/02d6a58d4ffd87a963caae87f97ad9fc.webm?t=1783924175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978460/extras/02d6a58d4ffd87a963caae87f97ad9fc.mp4?t=1783924175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A complex economic system</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage efficiently your empire colony's industrial output in a complex multiple resource economy: Iron, Copper, Hydrocarbon, energy, and many more. Establish new colonies, form trade routes and feed your extensive war machine to continue expansion and extermination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978460/extras/9282fa9fc353ce1bf2e01782ccbeb321.avif?t=1783924175\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Research scientific and not-so scientific theories</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Research multiple technologies in one of the four scientific and technological disciplines: Physics, Engineering, Biology, and Sociology. There is the forbidden knowledge research, obtained by non-conventional methods, and it may irreversibly bring your civilization closer to the abyss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978460/extras/b1aadbf0b20dbd780448b3c402719fe8.avif?t=1783924175\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Procedural storyteller system</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HARD VOID features multiple and interconnected procedural narrative events that will also shape each playthrough. Make decisions that affect the game universe in meaningful ways. Discover ancient artifacts, witness reality anomalies, including cosmic horror events. Will your forces succumb to madness?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HARD VOID is a Retro-style Lovecraft-inspired 4X space turn-based strategy game.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While recovering from past near-apocalyptic events, your civilization has developed faster-than-light travel methods under mysterious circumstances. Will this discovery lead to an age of space prosperity, or should some things better remain undiscovered?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Design your ships</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HARD VOID allows the design of your own spaceships with the selection of multiple ship systems: Weapons, Defense modules, Power sources, Sensors and more. Each ship system can be further customized with several parameters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally, the spaceship hulls are unique and generated procedurally.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978460/extras/32f9c385af18db79c6dad830f3ad16b5.avif?t=1783924175\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978460/extras/e68b800b5047f9d9215a68adc912c307.poster.avif?t=1783924175\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978460/extras/e68b800b5047f9d9215a68adc912c307.webm?t=1783924175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978460/extras/e68b800b5047f9d9215a68adc912c307.mp4?t=1783924175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Conquer the galaxy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In HARD VOID combat is turn-based, ships are grouped into fleets and commanded as a whole in large space battles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The combat system allows simultaneous participation of both space and ground forces: Fleets, orbital structures, planetary surface structure, land, air and sea units.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978460/extras/67c5e1c4b8572a8fddcc200e0100bccd.poster.avif?t=1783924175\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978460/extras/67c5e1c4b8572a8fddcc200e0100bccd.webm?t=1783924175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978460/extras/67c5e1c4b8572a8fddcc200e0100bccd.mp4?t=1783924175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Colonize the galaxy and multiple dimensions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use multiple FTL travel methods to explore and expand : WARP drives, Subspatial engines, Wormhole generators and more. Colonize planets, asteroids and multiple dimensions, but beware, you aren't only dealing with just other species, space travel unlocks horrors beyond comprehension that are waiting in the vast dark void and will trial your empire. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978460/extras/02d6a58d4ffd87a963caae87f97ad9fc.poster.avif?t=1783924175\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978460/extras/02d6a58d4ffd87a963caae87f97ad9fc.webm?t=1783924175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978460/extras/02d6a58d4ffd87a963caae87f97ad9fc.mp4?t=1783924175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A complex economic system</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage efficiently your empire colony's industrial output in a complex multiple resource economy: Iron, Copper, Hydrocarbon, energy, and many more. Establish new colonies, form trade routes and feed your extensive war machine to continue expansion and extermination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978460/extras/9282fa9fc353ce1bf2e01782ccbeb321.avif?t=1783924175\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Research scientific and not-so scientific theories</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Research multiple technologies in one of the four scientific and technological disciplines: Physics, Engineering, Biology, and Sociology. There is the forbidden knowledge research, obtained by non-conventional methods, and it may irreversibly bring your civilization closer to the abyss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978460/extras/b1aadbf0b20dbd780448b3c402719fe8.avif?t=1783924175\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Procedural storyteller system</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HARD VOID features multiple and interconnected procedural narrative events that will also shape each playthrough. Make decisions that affect the game universe in meaningful ways. Discover ancient artifacts, witness reality anomalies, including cosmic horror events. Will your forces succumb to madness?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "HARD VOID is a 4X turn-based space strategy game in a lovecraftian universe. Lead your species across galaxies and multiple dimensions to build an Empire. Design your spaceships, assemble your fleets and fight for supremacy. But beware, unthinkable Eldritch horrors lurk in the vast darkness.", "supported_languages": "English, Spanish - Latin America", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978460/0d32b9f9428255e523931ecde3e92993db67b488/header.jpg?t=1783924175", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978460/84bf973875d9e7e2fab7d225b26fd10e5a59b8d9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783924175", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.a